    "description": {
      "summary": "The target becomes paralyzed and freezes in place.",
      "value": "<p>The target becomes paralyzed and freezes in place. It is aware and breathes normally but cannot take any actions, even speech. Each round on its turn, the target may attempt a new saving throw to end the effect. This is a\nfull-round action\nthat does not provoke attacks of opportunity. A winged creature who is paralyzed cannot flap its wings and falls. A swimmer cannot swim and may drown.</p>"
